# Published figures the chart-datum corrections are held to (board item B24).
# Checked by tests/tides-zero-check.awk, which the suite runs.
#
#   id | check | published figure, m | least | most | where it is published
#
#   msl   the station's mean sea level above chart datum (its z0) must sit
#         between published+least and published+most
#   mhws  z0 + M2 + S2, the Admiralty approximation to mean high water
#         springs, held the same way
#   odn   the published figure is chart datum BELOW Ordnance Datum Newlyn;
#         z0 less that figure is mean sea level above Ordnance Datum, which
#         NTSLF puts at "about 0.2 m" today, so it is held between least and
#         most above it
#
# Every figure was read from the page named, on 16 November 2026, except
# Cherbourg's, read on 28 November 2026 from Shom's Références Altimétriques
# Maritimes (RAM), 2025 edition, through Shom's public map service (WFS layer
# RAM_BDD_WLD_WGS84G_WFS:ram_3857); Larry's ruling TBUP. None was copied from
# the station file. The RAM is "Shom, 2025. Références Altimétriques
# Maritimes, https://dx.doi.org/10.17183/MAREE_COURANTS_RAM", Licence Ouverte
# / Open Licence 2.0; Shom says of it "ce produit ne doit pas être utilisé
# pour la navigation" (this product must not be used for navigation). Here it
# only checks a figure; see NOTICE.
ticon/brest-3-fra-refmar|msl|4.13|-0.05|0.05|Shom niveau moyen, as maree.info prints it (06/2016), maree.info/82/ports-rattaches
ticon/le_conquet-152-fra-refmar|msl|3.98|-0.05|0.05|Shom niveau moyen, as maree.info prints it (06/2016), maree.info/82/ports-rattaches
ticon/portsmouth-ptm-gbr-bodc|mhws|4.7|-0.05|0.05|Admiralty chart 5600, Portsmouth MHWS
ticon/portsmouth-ptm-gbr-bodc|odn|2.73|0.10|0.30|NTSLF, chart datum relative to Ordnance Datum, ntslf.org/tides/datum
ticon/weymouth-wey-gbr-bodc|odn|0.93|0.10|0.30|NTSLF, chart datum relative to Ordnance Datum, ntslf.org/tides/datum
ticon/devonport-dev-gbr-bodc|odn|3.22|0.10|0.30|NTSLF, chart datum relative to Ordnance Datum, ntslf.org/tides/datum
ticon/cherbourg-13-fra-refmar|msl|3.87|-0.05|0.05|Shom, 2025. Références Altimétriques Maritimes (NM), https://dx.doi.org/10.17183/MAREE_COURANTS_RAM
